{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52498","headline":"闻杨炯幽兰之歌作（题拟） · 赵元淑","name":"闻杨炯幽兰之歌作（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔闻兰叶据龙图，复道兰林引凤雏。\n鸿归燕去紫茎歇，露往霜来绿叶枯。\n（《杨盈川集》卷一《幽兰赋》附）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵元淑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52498.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52498","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}